      <span class="section-kicker">About Bella</span>
      <h2 class="dark-title">Analysis with a view of the whole system.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Bella Grant is the founder and director of Pathway Analytics. Her career spans investment banking, equity research, strategy consulting, health economics, national public-health analysis and political campaigning.</p>
      <p>She is particularly interested in work where finance, service delivery and equity intersect: how resources flow, who is reached, where people are lost from a pathway, and whether a programme is producing enough value to justify continuation or scale.</p>
      <p>In 2024 she stood as the Liberal Democrat parliamentary candidate for Fareham and Waterlooville, building a campaign from scratch and receiving 9,533 votes. She also serves in local civic and voluntary roles.</p>
      <p class="small">MBA, London Business School, including exchange at Kellogg School of Management · BA History, Durham University · Diploma in Business French, King's College London.</p>
